  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Alcohol and Drug Addiction Services: Partnership with The Salvation Army - Fiji Samoa, Tonga</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Three-year partnership with The Salvation Army New Zealand Trust (TSA), working to prevent, address and reduce social harm from alcohol and other drug (AOD) use in Fiji, Tonga, and Samoa by providing community-based intervention and rehabilitation services, workforce training and community education and outreach.</narrative>
  </description>
